{
 "schema": "rpg-factory.comfy-known-nodes/1",
 "note": "Offline snapshot of the ComfyUI node inputs and outputs the asset-gen templates use (comfyui_9router custom node and core nodes; ImageBatch, deprecated in the frontend but stable in API format, chains style-lock anchors into reference_images). The core image node entries (ImageScale through PrimitiveString) are written by nodesync.py from a saved object_info (live ComfyUI 0.45.2; fixture tests/fixtures/assetgen/object_info.json); the 9router and IO entries stay hand-kept. Inputs are listed in the order ComfyUI declares them (required, then optional): the UI workflow (uiworkflow.py) writes widgets_values in that order. assetgen.py lint checks templates and rendered workflows against it; the live check stays with comfy-mcp validate_workflow. warn_values flags input values known to fail at run time; ui holds the canvas node size and extra widget values (LoadImage's upload button) of workflow.ui.json. ui_only nodes (Note, MarkdownNote) exist only on the frontend canvas: lint rejects them in an API workflow. The 13 local core entries come from live ComfyUI 0.45.2 object_info (fixture tests/fixtures/assetgen/object_info.json); model-file combos are empty there, so ckpt_name, lora_name, control_net_name and model_name are STRING. The pack entries come from pack source at the pinned commits (fixture tests/fixtures/assetgen/object_info-packs.json) because no saved object_info from a machine with the packs exists. packs maps each hardware.json pack id to its nodes; local_model_nodes lists the nodes that need a template requires block. UNTESTED on RTX 5060: the local nodes have not run on the target machine.",
